{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00680",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 9.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Doctor, hello. Sorry, it is my son Arjun, he is limping, I think, since a few days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.92,
      "end_seconds": 18.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Hello Arjun, hello Mrs Menon. Arjun, you're seven, is that right? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.14,
      "end_seconds": 24.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Seven and a half. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.37,
      "end_seconds": 33.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Seven and a half. Arjun, when did your leg start to hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.75,
      "end_seconds": 37.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Yesterday. One day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 40.79,
      "end_seconds": 48.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "No, no, beta. It is three days, since Saturday. You told me on Saturday evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.71,
      "end_seconds": 61.2,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "So Arjun says one day, and Mum says three days. I'll write down one to three days for now. Arjun, where does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.57,
      "end_seconds": 66.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Here. My knee. And this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.7,
      "end_seconds": 76.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Does it hurt when you stand on it, or all the time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.03,
      "end_seconds": 83.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "When I walk. Not when I sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.56,
      "end_seconds": 91.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Did you fall, or hurt it playing football or at school?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 93.38,
      "end_seconds": 101.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "No, he didn't say anything about a fall. The teacher didn't tell us either."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.1,
      "end_seconds": 108.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Has he had any fever, been feeling hot or unwell?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 110.94,
      "end_seconds": 117.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "No fever, no. He's eating, he's playing, only he walks funny."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.3,
      "end_seconds": 121.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Does Arjun take any medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 123.45,
      "end_seconds": 136.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "The montelukast for his asthma, 5 mg at night, every day. And I gave ibuprofen, 5 ml, only last night when he was crying."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.7,
      "end_seconds": 143.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Right. And what other health problems has he had?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 146.15,
      "end_seconds": 151.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Asthma since he was three, and eczema, on the elbows."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.67,
      "end_seconds": 156.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Does he have any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 158.43,
      "end_seconds": 162.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Peanuts. He gets hives and his lips swell."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.47,
      "end_seconds": 177.03,
      "duration_seconds": 12.56,
      "text": "Thank you, that's very important. Arjun, I'm going to look at how you walk. Can you walk to the door and back? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.23,
      "end_seconds": 200.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.68,
      "end_seconds": 218.0,
      "duration_seconds": 15.32,
      "text": "He's limping on the right side, he spends less time on the right leg, and the hip moves fully in all directions, with no pain when I move it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 219.66,
      "end_seconds": 223.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Is it his hip? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.43,
      "end_seconds": 241.67,
      "duration_seconds": 16.24,
      "text": "The hip moves well, which is reassuring. The knee isn't swollen and isn't hot. I can't see a clear cause today, and I don't want to put a name on it yet. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 242.52,
      "end_seconds": 245.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "What should we do? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.99,
      "end_seconds": 263.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.23,
      "text": "Rest from sports for a few days, and let him walk as he feels able. You can give the ibuprofen if he's sore, with food."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 265.89,
      "end_seconds": 269.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "He loves football, he will complain. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.59,
      "end_seconds": 281.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.79,
      "text": "A few days off won't hurt him. Is he sleeping well, is the pain waking him? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 283.81,
      "end_seconds": 287.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "No, he sleeps through. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.51,
      "end_seconds": 296.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Good. I'd like to see him again in three days, to check how he's walking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 298.49,
      "end_seconds": 303.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Three days, fine. And if it gets worse? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.21,
      "end_seconds": 318.14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "If he gets a fever, can't put weight on the leg at all, or the knee swells up, bring him straight in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 320.05,
      "end_seconds": 323.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I will. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.72,
      "end_seconds": 328.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Bye, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
